> mention of the PDF conversion

@parkr I mentioned it to cover our base from those users who may be already using a local plugin and the builtin pdf-converter from kramdown-v1 and from those new users who stumble upon the `kramdown-converter-pdf` extension gem and expect Jekyll to handle the conversion without further user-involvement (like how the other kramdown extension gems for `*-gfm`, `*-coderay`, `*-mathjax`, etc work).
Either ways, GitHub Pages shouldn't face an issue.
